320.description:
Create a hero! And not just any simple game character, but a full-fledged Hero with a capital "H," loved and respected — that's the game's main goal. You'll have to find the means yourself.

Game features:
- strategy genre;
- the player will constantly have to make choices, and not just what to wear today, but vital and pressing ones;
- each move made by a player takes away one year from his total lifespan... not a bad risk;
- You are limited in time, but this does not change the goal - gain the respect of others, show what you are capable of!
- "Life is short" in the literal sense - your task is to make it!
- You can download a torrent on our website. Hero Generations when will it be officially released?
